 (text "cell 4 (block 2)" (at 538.48 43.18 0) (effects (font (size 1.50 1.50)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid c58815db-7ef6-5219-a571-12125ab5953f))
 (text "RS1-RS4: PMK UFCS-R001 1 mOhm coaxial shunt, IN = LS source (LSRCx), SHLD = DC-" (at 393.70 152.40 0) (effects (font (size 1.50 1.50)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 91660c9c-e049-50c8-b463-a9a6a149dcb5))
 (text "J22: AC output, M6 bolt pad, 12 x 5 mm Cu bar bolted on" (at 604.52 101.60 0) (effects (font (size 1.50 1.50)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 2ea37f94-e551-55fe-b688-d0a80e39b2ee))
 (text "the bar passes through a LEM HO 250-S (off board," (at 604.52 105.41 0) (effects (font (size 1.50 1.50)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid f11e732d-cb8f-5757-bb2a-15598f4d718d))
 (text "3.2 mV/A, JST PHR-5 straight to the C2000)" (at 604.52 109.22 0) (effects (font (size 1.50 1.50)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 2eb72ea2-03e6-56e9-8f6a-e5addf7d4b98))
 (text "DC link present LED, R50 100 k bleeder" (at 627.38 157.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.50 1.50)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 7d6a092a-36c2-5eb3-9de6-8122a50752a7))
 (text "NTC on the heatsink side, DC- referenced:" (at 693.42 60.96 0) (effects (font (size 1.50 1.50)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 9000ae3d-a74c-517c-b38e-3113111623ee))
 (text "J23 is in the LS domain (high voltage)" (at 693.42 64.77 0) (effects (font (size 1.50 1.50)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 45075e84-4cd2-51c5-83aa-f928af7472bb))
 (text "GATE DRIVER BLOCKS: control header with common-mode chokes, 2EDF7275K input filters, R_ON / D + R_OFF, star, R_G per transistor (block 1 drives Q1-Q4, block 2 drives Q5-Q8)" (at 25.40 182.88 0) (effects (font (size 2.00 2.00) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 85722470-eeba-534f-8843-78a4e72c7df7))
 (text "BLOCK 1" (at 30.48 190.50 0) (effects (font (size 1.80 1.80) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 1b326970-8fe4-5a5e-9468-b84d29d6e46a))
 (text "SLDON = GNDI: input-side LDO on" (at 139.70 248.92 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 7e4e3ae8-14ed-5671-9573-9500465b95c8))
 (text "R_ON 0.75 R, R_OFF 0 R (jumper), R_G 0.5 R per transistor, 10 k gate pull-down at the star to the Kelvin net" (at 139.70 251.46 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid a3b44ab7-9e45-5d61-82bd-fd2a43b1fe75))
 (text "BLOCK 2" (at 436.88 190.50 0) (effects (font (size 1.80 1.80) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 01c1d624-0c4e-5034-b582-1fa59a807b53))
 (text "SLDON = GNDI: input-side LDO on" (at 546.10 248.92 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid fad6c202-70c6-50fb-98c5-748ac339af4d))
 (text "R_ON 0.75 R, R_OFF 0 R (jumper), R_G 0.5 R per transistor, 10 k gate pull-down at the star to the Kelvin net" (at 546.10 251.46 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 4cba8555-a36a-5dcb-a82c-ae6caa4a335e))
 (text "GATE SUPPLY ISLANDS: external isolated supply (one HS, one LS, split per block) -> WE-CNSW -> 5.1 V Zener VDD-S, 150 R bias S-VEE: V_GS,on = +5.1 V, V_GS,off = -(V_ISO - 5.1 V)" (at 25.40 266.70 0) (effects (font (size 2.00 2.00) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 84e00933-c893-5e67-ae5f-7598258af5d7))
 (text "J3 / L1: HS block 1" (at 33.02 314.96 0) (effects (font (size 1.50 1.50)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 5bd096e6-f07e-5fb8-8dae-5d9475d6af56))
 (text "J4 / L2: LS block 1" (at 236.22 314.96 0) (effects (font (size 1.50 1.50)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 3c3f1f6d-4c03-50b1-9154-4832df1763de))
 (text "J12 / L6: HS block 2" (at 439.42 314.96 0) (effects (font (size 1.50 1.50)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid d047d3ab-afff-5fb2-8348-cbd70532fdff))
 (text "J13 / L7: LS block 2" (at 642.62 314.96 0) (effects (font (size 1.50 1.50)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid d8e7d5e8-476d-582e-b2c5-981f866a7c62))
 (text "U.FL MEASUREMENT PORTS (bottom side, at each cell): V_GS HS / LS (0 R, shield = Kelvin), V_DS LS (953 R series = 20:1 into the 50 R scope input, shield = LS source LSRCx)" (at 25.40 325.12 0) (effects (font (size 2.00 2.00) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 91a9c2d9-d3de-58f5-9af3-5f67954fb52a))
 (text "MOUNTING: H1-H4 board corners (insulated), H5-H7 heatsink spreader; heatsink HS1 (Fischer LAM 4, 100 mm, rotated 90 deg, tube across the board width) is a board-only item" (at 25.40 383.54 0) (effects (font (size 2.00 2.00) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid bc077812-9ceb-5878-806a-9683a2bdac81))
 (text "Nets: DCP = DC+, DCN = DC-, SW = joined switch node of all four cells.  KH1/KH2 and KL1/KL2 are the Kelvin source nets (pad 2 of each EPC2361); they meet the power source only inside the package." (at 25.40 414.02 0) (effects (font (size 1.50 1.50)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 4c188317-8dfc-5b7d-88a4-a613459505ea))
 (text "LSRC1-LSRC4: LS power source of each cell = UFCS IN; the shunt SHLD side is DC-.  The LS gate drive and the LS supply are referenced to the Kelvin net KLx, not to DC-." (at 25.40 419.10 0) (effects (font (size 1.50 1.50)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 4378482a-69a0-5fba-bcf8-b8077fc784fe))
 (text "Block suffix 1/2 on every driver-side net (GNDI1, VDDA2, ...).  Primary side: GNDIx and +12Vx come from the control header through a common-mode choke per pair (12 V/GND, PWM_H/PWM_L, DIS)." (at 25.40 424.18 0) (effects (font (size 1.50 1.50)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid b423c9e5-cd30-5f2d-a855-1fc57c4606cf))
 (text "No short-circuit protection on this board.  Closed-loop control from a TI TMS320F28379D over the CTRL headers." (at 25.40 429.26 0) (effects (font (size 1.50 1.50)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 8846f443-8dc7-57f0-a3d9-0b16f00b4fb5))
